[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 13205.51, "timestamp": "03:40:05", "text": "哦，不。该死。是的，我当时和……住在一起"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13208.309, "timestamp": "03:40:08", "text": "我当时住在加藤家。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13211.19, "timestamp": "03:40:11", "text": "现在。所以他妈妈经常喂我吃东西。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13214.389, "timestamp": "03:40:14", "text": "事情太多了，我就想，我不能，安迪。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13217.51, "timestamp": "03:40:17", "text": "不能。我肚子饱了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13221.11, "timestamp": "03:40:21", "text": "他们听得懂英语吗？哦，是的。呃"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13225.03, "timestamp": "03:40:25", "text": "她妈妈懂马拉雅拉姆语，但是她"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13228.07, "timestamp": "03:40:28", "text": "她当时是半个马拉利人，她也知道"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13238.389, "timestamp": "03:40:38", "text": "是的。但那是一次很好的经历。但"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13240.87, "timestamp": "03:40:40", "text": "我唯一讨厌布匿战争的地方就是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13243.19, "timestamp": "03:40:43", "text": "那次旅行，整个旅行都是……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13245.91, "timestamp": "03:40:45", "text": "印度火车之类的东西。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13248.63, "timestamp": "03:40:48", "text": "是的。是的。我没找到座位。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13251.59, "timestamp": "03:40:51", "text": "在回家的路上。我当时真的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13255.67, "timestamp": "03:40:55", "text": "跳跃，呃，不能换座位"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13257.51, "timestamp": "03:40:57", "text": "小时。"}]